  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: " As the dawn of a new day begins, you feel a shift in the air. The usual
    ambient sounds, those of people talking on the phone and watching videos, slowly
    dim; instead, it\u2019s replaced by the sound of horse hooves on dirt packed
    roads, and carriage wheels rolling along. As the change settles, you take stock
    of what you know: This is your coffee shop, and you are a barista. Similar to
    the magic treehouse books you\u2019ve read as a child, your shop has the unique
    ability to travel through time and space. At this particular juncture, you\u2019ve
    found yourself in Puerto Rico, specifically during the 19th century. It\u2019s
    a turning point for the island, one specifically driven by coffee, which you
    happen to be especially equipped to experience. With that knowledge settled,
    you find yourself flipping the \u201Copen\u201D sign on the door, ready to take
    on an entirely new array of customers."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cc75aa6b0f1ce0b45940c3d03cb1f738, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -1355184089515119403, guid: cc75aa6b0f1ce0b45940c3d03cb1f738, type: 2}
