  m_text: 'Bacon ipsum dolor amet turducken shank beef tail pastrami capicola. Beef
    prosciutto kevin tail, andouille doner meatball beef ribs shankle meatloaf pig
    chislic pastrami jowl. Swine pancetta beef ribs, chuck buffalo corned beef tenderloin
    shankle burgdoggen meatball. Biltong tenderloin ribeye tail ham alcatra spare
    ribs hamburger ground round jowl flank filet mignon t-bone boudin.



    Biltong
    ham hock pork cupim spare ribs shoulder ball tip meatball beef boudin picanha
    salami. Short loin kielbasa alcatra, t-bone short ribs shank picanha ham hock
    flank pork chop chislic. Beef ribs pig tongue, corned beef boudin ham chislic.
    Capicola picanha biltong porchetta filet mignon buffalo ground round pork belly
    t-bone doner frankfurter jerky ball tip. Prosciutto bacon boudin alcatra. Boudin
    brisket ham burgdoggen chuck picanha kevin drumstick porchetta sirloin chicken.
    Kevin fatback andouille, drumstick turducken alcatra shoulder.



    T-bone
    boudin meatball fatback corned beef pastrami jerky, shankle hamburger. Ribeye
    ham short loin, buffalo tri-tip sausage beef ribs pork loin turducken meatloaf
    brisket. Leberkas burgdoggen ham hock, bresaola ribeye pork buffalo biltong tail
    meatloaf shank. Andouille short ribs sirloin beef short loin, kielbasa salami
    prosciutto drumstick ball tip pork flank pastrami turkey biltong. Corned beef
    shank leberkas frankfurter biltong, meatball alcatra sausage boudin prosciutto
    picanha.'
