      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "As the sky darkens and your last customer for the night leaves, you find
    yourself contemplating the new information you\u2019ve learned. The coffee boom
    in Puerto Rico was a trigger that shifted the very foundations of Puerto Ricon
    identity, economy, labor, and even agriculture; an event that impacted the different
    social classes within the island in varying ways, leading to an economic shift
    of which the consequences are still visible even today. With that in mind, you
    close shop, already imagining where you\u2019ll end up next. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cc75aa6b0f1ce0b45940c3d03cb1f738, type: 2}
